  "description": "<p>There are a lot of concepts exposed via headers which clients need to be able to interact with. It would be helpful to provide users with the Fedora defined/used values and make them easier to locate. This could include:</p>\n\n<p>GET Prefer header relation values</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#PreferInboundReferences\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#PreferInboundReferences</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#PreferContainedDescriptions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#PreferContainedDescriptions</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferContainment\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferContainment</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMembership\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMembership</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMinimalContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMinimalContainer</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Constants for versioning types</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeMap\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeMap</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#Memento\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#Memento</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Constants for link header rels</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent</a></li>\n\t<li>acl</li>\n\t<li>original</li>\n\t<li>timegate</li>\n\t<li>timemap</li>\n\t<li>describes / describedby</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Constants for non-standard header names</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Accept-External-Content-Handling</li>\n\t<li>Accept-Datetime</li>\n\t<li>Memento-datetime</li>\n\t<li>X-State-Token</li>\n\t<li>X-If-State-Token</li>\n\t<li>etc</li>\n</ul>\n",
